---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { contacts, LINE_CLEARANCE_FT } from '../data/site';
import { u } from '../lib/url';
---
<Base
  title="No signal"
  description="You are offline and this page was not cached. Here is what matters most."
>
  <div class="shell railed flow off">
    <span class="rail-mark" aria-hidden="true">!</span>
    <h1>No signal, and this page was not saved</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      The rest of the site is on your phone. This particular page was not, which usually
      means it is new since the last time you opened the site with a connection.
    </p>

    <aside class="hazard">
      <p class="hazard__label">If a line is down</p>
      <p>
        Assume it is energized. Stay {LINE_CLEARANCE_FT} feet back. Call
        <a href="tel:911">911</a>, then KIUC at
        <a href={`tel:${contacts.kiuc.tel}`}>808-246-4300</a>. Never cut a tree touching,
        near, or able to reach a line.
      </p>
      <p>
        Feet together, small shuffling steps to get clear. Never a stride, never a run.
      </p>
    </aside>

    <h2>The two questions, before every cut</h2>
    <p class="lead">What is holding this up? Where does it go when it moves?</p>
    <p>If you cannot answer both out loud, do not cut. Flag it and wait.</p>

    <h2>Pages you already have</h2>
    <ul class="index">
      <li><a href={u('/modules/12-downed-power-lines/')}>
        <span class="index__title">Downed power lines</span>
        <span class="index__flag">Life safety</span>
      </a></li>
      <li><a href={u('/modules/00-before-you-touch-a-saw/')}>
        <span class="index__title">Before you touch a saw</span>
      </a></li>
      <li><a href={u('/field-card/')}>
        <span class="index__title">Field card</span>
      </a></li>
      <li><a href={u('/modules/')}>
        <span class="index__title">All modules</span>
      </a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .off { padding-top: 2rem; }
</style>
